@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5081
@apiKey = devkey

### Get Monitor (live state)
GET {{HostAddress}}/monitor
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Run Monitor (check now)
POST {{HostAddress}}/monitor/run
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Pause Monitor
POST {{HostAddress}}/monitor/pause
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Resume Monitor
POST {{HostAddress}}/monitor/resume
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
